// std.wayland: native Wayland client and server for Mlx.
//
// Everything here is ordinary Mlx. The protocol modules under
// wayland/generated were materialized from the canonical XML under
// std/protocols/wayland by std.wayland.materialize during the standard-library
// bootstrap; applications only write
//
//     const wl = @import("std.wayland")
//
// and use wl.client or wl.server with the per-interface namespaces below
// (wl.wl_compositor, wl.xdg_toplevel, ...). Each namespace provides the
// interface version, request/event opcodes and since-versions, enums with
// the exact XML values, the client `Proxy` and server `Resource` types, and
// `decodeEvent`/`decodeRequest`.

